(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF MICRO, SMALL AND MEDIUM ENTERPRISES) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: PROCUREMENT AND MARKETING SUPPORT \(PMS\) SCHEME \(PMS\) / OFFICE OF DC-MSME) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Promotes new market access initiatives, participation in) Tj
T*
(national/international trade fairs, vendor development, and modern) Tj
T*
(e-commerce onboarding.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Micro and Small Enterprises with valid Udyam Registration.) Tj
T*
(2. Enterprises participating in state, national, or international trade) Tj
T*
(   exhibitions and expos.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. 100% stall charge reimbursement for SC/ST, Women, and NER entrepreneurs) Tj
T*
(   up to Rs. 1.5 Lakh for National Fairs; 80% for General MSEs.) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 100.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 1.5 Lakh per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. Udyam Registration) Tj
T*
(2. GST Certificate) Tj
T*
(3. Exhibition Stall Booking Receipt & Allotment Letter) Tj
T*
(4. Photographs of stall during expo) Tj
T*
(5. Cancelled Cheque) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online via MyMSME Portal) Tj
T*
